// Code transport (Specification §18.6), as far as M7 reaches. An
// `Expr[F]` is a closure of the `is Pure` function type `F` that a closure
// literal or a `pub` function becomes where the context asks for one; it
// is usable anywhere an `F` is (Implementation Plan §11.10.13).

pub type Expr[F]
